{"title":"Orc Warrior","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 20 Orc that attacks with slash (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">freeze</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">shock</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">slash</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/orcish-grip-wrap\">Orcish Grip Wrap</a> <span class=\"muted\">(rerolls quality)</span>. A small chance on any kill, far better from elites. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/orc-warrior\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/orc-warrior?lv=20\">Lv 20</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/orc-warrior?lv=21\">Lv 21 <span>54</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/orc-warrior?lv=22\">Lv 22 <span>84</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/orc-warrior?lv=20\" title=\"Pick level 20\"><td><b>20</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>66</td><td>15.5</td><td>1,000</td><td class=\"muted\">198 · 21.7 · 3,000</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/orc-warrior?lv=21\" title=\"Pick level 21\"><td><b>21</b></td><td>70</td><td>16.1</td><td>1,050</td><td class=\"muted\">210 · 22.5 · 3,150</td><td>54</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Skentz%20Scrapyard\">Skentz Scrapyard</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/orc-warrior?lv=22\" title=\"Pick level 22\"><td><b>22</b></td><td>74</td><td>16.6</td><td>1,100</td><td class=\"muted\">222 · 23.2 · 3,300</td><td>84</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Skentz%20Scrapyard\">Skentz Scrapyard</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      <h2>Appearance</h2><p class=\"s muted\">How the game draws it. Archers and mages wear better armor as their level goes up.</p><div class=\"look-grid\"><div class=\"look-card\"><img src=\"data/img/9cbd76d9dddefef7ba8a.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Plain</b><div class=\"g-note\">Any level</div></div></div><div class=\"look-card\"><img src=\"data/img/7a79d4ba8136e0732f4f.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Archer</b><div class=\"g-note\">Level 15–24 · Bearhide armor</div></div></div><div class=\"look-card\"><img src=\"data/img/c854049b58fc7fcf76a4.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Mage (Acid)</b><div class=\"g-note\">Level 15–24 · Snakeskin armor</div></div></div><div class=\"look-card\"><img src=\"data/img/e3627e7977ab984ee639.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Mage (Fire)</b><div class=\"g-note\">Level 15–24 · Snakeskin armor</div></div></div><div class=\"look-card\"><img src=\"data/img/3102261c6bc1bf4a06b3.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Mage (Ice)</b><div class=\"g-note\">Level 15–24 · Snakeskin armor</div></div></div><div class=\"look-card\"><img src=\"data/img/56bcc8be9ccc1dd691fd.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Mage (Shock)</b><div class=\"g-note\">Level 15–24 · Snakeskin armor</div></div></div><div class=\"look-card\"><img src=\"data/img/9cbd76d9dddefef7ba8a.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Warrior</b><div class=\"g-note\">Any level</div></div></div></div>\n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - 10 recorded drops, 305 total, 19–43 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">10 drops</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Percentages are of the corpses whose loot the collector recorded, so kills you did not loot are not counted.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-285.4px,-1338.8px)\"><img src=\"tiles/4/0/4.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:0px;top:1024px\"><img src=\"tiles/4/0/5.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:0px;top:1280px\"><img src=\"tiles/4/1/4.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:256px;top:1024px\"><img src=\"tiles/4/1/5.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:256px;top:1280px\"><i style=\"left:265.4px;top:1375.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:212.6px;top:1337.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:185.6px;top:1361.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:346.8px;top:1376.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:291.1px;top:1316.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:230.2px;top:1368.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:300.6px;top:1406.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:308.4px;top:1303.2px\"></i><i style=\"left:251.9px;top:1359.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:254.6px;top:1349.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:335.8px;top:1375.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:195.1px;top:1359.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:314.1px;top:1398.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:242.4px;top:1334.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:380.4px;top:1361.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:389.9px;top:1348.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:215.4px;top:1334.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:276.2px;top:1372.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:294.0px;top:1354.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:306.0px;top:1357.9px\"></i></div><figcaption>Skentz Scrapyard</figcaption></figure><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Skentz%20Scrapyard\">Skentz Scrapyard</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 13 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Antlion%20Hive\">Antlion Hive</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 10 spots</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"orc-warrior\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Orc: <a href=\"#/monster/orc\">Orc</a> <span class=\"muted\">(9)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/orc-grunt\">Orc Grunt</a> <span class=\"muted\">(18)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/orc-shieldwall\">Orc Shieldwall</a> <span class=\"muted\">(22)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/orc-berserker\">Orc Berserker</a> <span class=\"muted\">(24)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/orc-warchief\">Orc Warchief</a> <span class=\"muted\">(26)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/32180983f5b9c9e8250b.webp\" alt=\"Orc Warrior\"></div><h3>Orc Warrior</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>20 <span class=\"muted\">(seen 21–22)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Orc</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>slash · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>66</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>15.5</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>1000</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>4.1 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>Yes</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>35 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}